From: Niklas Klein <niklas.klein@erynoa.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 13:30:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ragfit: OIDC login only for listed teams (0003
 oidc-login-gate)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Rejects OIDC logins without an allowed team when RAGFIT_OIDC_<PROVIDER>_LOGIN_GROUPS is set.
See CHANGES-RAGFIT.md. GPLv3 §10.
